Ka pānuihia e Synix me te tirotiro i te kohinga katoa:

{0}

Kaore he kino i kitea, kaore hoki nga konae i kawemai.

Kaore he waahi noa hei kaweake i te Synix.

{0}

Waihohia he wāhi, tīpakohia tētahi atu wāhi whakaora, ka ngana anō.

